id: router_install_code
label: Router Install Code Self-Provision
package: custom
description: >-
  One-time self-provisioning of a random installation-code manufacturing token.
  The ZBT-2 ships without a factory MFG_INSTALLATION_CODE, so an R23 router has
  no pre-shared secret for DLK (SPEKE/Curve25519) key negotiation and cannot
  join an R23 coordinator. On first boot (token blank) this generates a random
  16-byte install code with the hardware TRNG, writes the MFG token, and resets
  so the next boot reads a valid token.
category: Zigbee|Router
quality: production
provides:
  - name: router_install_code
requires:
  - name: ohf_runtime
  - name: psa_crypto
  - name: token_manager
  - name: zigbee_pro_stack
template_contribution:
  - name: ohf_rust_feature
    value: router_install_code
  - name: zigbee_af_callback
    value:
      callback_type: event_init
      function_name: router_install_code_init
